---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="服务条款" titleEn="Terms of Service">
  <div class="container page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-zh="服务条款">Terms of service</div>
    <h1 data-zh="服务条款">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="lead" data-zh="使用 x-Reply-Helper 前，请了解 AI 回复草稿、账户额度和付款的相关说明。">Before using x-Reply-Helper, please read how AI reply drafts, account credits, and payments work.</p>
  </div>
  <article class="container legal">
    <h2 data-zh="1. AI 回复草稿与使用方式">1. AI reply drafts and use</h2>
    <p data-zh="x-Reply-Helper 根据你选择的 X 帖子及回复风格生成可编辑的 AI 回复草稿。AI 内容可能不准确或不适合当前语境，不保证关注增长、曝光或任何特定效果。请自行检查事实、措辞和使用权限，并决定是否发送。插件不会替你自动发布 X 评论。">x-Reply-Helper generates editable AI reply drafts from the X post you select and your reply style. AI content may be inaccurate or unsuitable for the context. Followers, reach, and particular outcomes are not guaranteed. Review facts, wording, and your right to use the content before deciding whether to send it. The extension does not automatically publish X replies.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="2. 账户与免费额度">2. Accounts and free credits</h2>
    <p data-zh="新用户完成邮箱验证后，一次性获得 200 次免费生成额度，额度不主动过期。请妥善保管账户和绑定设备的访问权限。请勿利用服务发送垃圾信息、冒用他人身份、侵犯他人权利或从事其他滥用行为，并遵守 X 平台规则。">New users receive 200 free generations once after email verification, without a scheduled expiry. Protect access to your account and bound devices. Do not use the service for spam, impersonation, infringement of others' rights, or other abuse, and follow X's rules.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="3. 生成与额度结算">3. Generation and credit usage</h2>
    <p data-zh="生成额度在回复结果确认交付给插件后扣除；是否最终发布草稿，不影响已经完成的生成。生成失败不会按成功生成扣次。同一请求重试和交付确认采用防重复处理。网络异常时，额度可能暂时预占，随后根据请求结果完成确认或释放；如有疑问，请联系客服核查。">A generation credit is deducted after the reply result is confirmed delivered to the extension. Choosing not to publish a draft does not undo a completed generation. A failed generation is not charged as successful. Retries and delivery confirmations are handled to prevent duplicate charges for the same request. During a network issue, a credit may be temporarily reserved until the request is confirmed or released. Contact support if you need a usage record checked.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="4. 套餐、价格与支付">4. Packages, prices, and payment</h2>
    <p data-zh="套餐包含的生成次数、购买是否开放及可用支付方式，以套餐和结账页面的实际显示为准。美元价格用于参考展示，付款前的确认页面会列明人民币实付金额和币种；支付机构实际按页面确认的人民币金额收款。人民币售价已包含支付渠道成本，收银台不再额外加收。">The package and checkout pages show the included generations, purchase availability, and available payment methods. USD prices are for reference. Before payment, the confirmation page shows the actual CNY amount and currency; the payment provider collects the confirmed CNY amount. Payment processing costs are included in the displayed CNY price. No additional fee at checkout.</p>
    <p data-zh="付款结果须经支付平台的可信通知或订单查询核实后确认，购买额度按对应订单记录发放。若付款后暂未到账、出现重复扣款或订单金额疑问，请保留订单号并联系我们；不要仅因页面暂未更新而重复付款。">Payment is confirmed using a trusted payment-provider notification or order query, and purchased credits are granted according to the order record. If credits are delayed, you see duplicate charges, or you have a question about the amount, keep your order number and contact us. Do not pay again solely because a page has not yet updated.</p>

    <h2 data-zh="5. 付款问题与退款请求">5. Payment issues and refund requests</h2>
    <p data-zh="付款及退款请求会结合订单记录、服务使用情况和适用规则核查处理。本页不预先承诺特定退款金额或处理时限，也不限制消费者依法享有的权利。请参阅退款说明，或通过客服渠道提出具体问题。">Payment issues and refund requests are reviewed against order records, service usage, and applicable rules. This page does not promise a particular refund amount or processing time and does not limit statutory consumer rights. See the refund information or contact support about your case.</p>
    <p><a href="/refunds/" data-zh="查看退款说明">Read refund information</a></p>

    <h2 data-zh="6. 服务可用性与隐私">6. Availability and privacy</h2>
    <p data-zh="服务可能因上游故障、网络异常、维护、滥用防护或成本安全预算而暂时不可用。账户、回复生成、本地历史和支付数据的处理方式，请参阅隐私政策。">The service may be temporarily unavailable due to provider outages, network issues, maintenance, abuse prevention, or cost safety budgets. See the privacy policy for how account, generation, local history, and payment data are processed.</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy/" data-zh="查看隐私政策">Read the privacy policy</a></p>

    <h2 data-zh="7. 联系客服">7. Contact support</h2>
    <p data-zh="如有服务、额度、付款或隐私问题，可发送邮件至下方客服邮箱，或登录后通过反馈页面联系。请提供必要的问题说明；不要发送密码、验证码、API Key 或完整支付凭证。">For service, credit, payment, or privacy questions, email the support address below or use the feedback page after signing in. Provide the details needed to explain your issue; do not send passwords, verification codes, API keys, or full payment credentials.</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:zake6678@outlook.com">zake6678@outlook.com</a> · <a href="/feedback/" data-zh="反馈页面（需登录）">Feedback page (sign-in required)</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
